      ],
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Fragment card smoke test\n\nThree **Fragment** cards stand in for one piece of this node. They are the same piece at three sizes.\n\n1. **Look.** Each card draws a face of the piece: its Detail when it is big, its Summary smaller, its Icon smallest. Each face says which one it is.\n2. **Resize.** Drag a card's corner, or zoom the view, and watch the face change.\n3. **Open.** Press the unfold button on a card's title bar. The piece's nodes come in beside it and the button turns into a fold. Press it again and they go.\n4. **Save.** The file never gains the included nodes."
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "fragment-card-host"
        }
      }
    },
